      "timestamp": "2026-04-25T01:28:40+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "You know you live in the greatest country in the world, when the loudest critics still choose to stay.\n\nThere\u2019s no place like \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8. \n\nHowever, it\u2019ll take every ounce of fight by the next generation to keep it great.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2047491736914575786",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-24T01:44:05+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Leaders don\u2019t just create followers, but they create  leaders.\n\nIf others replicate what you do. day in and day out, would they win?",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2047336694190653883",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-23T15:28:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
