      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Great news.\n\nEight Iranian women protesters who were scheduled to be executed tonight will now be spared.\n\nThink about that for a moment, \na world where a U.S. president has to ask another country (IRGC) to show mercy to eight women.\n\nRespect to the President.\n\n\nThe White House (@WhiteHouse)\n\n\u201cVery good news! I have just been informed that eight women protestors who were going to be executed tonight in Iran will no longer be killed\u2026\u201d - President Donald J. Trump \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/White",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2047014226267353521",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-22T18:06:37+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
